00:07:09,230 --> 00:07:15,230
White Man's Town... Black Man's Law!

2
00:14:18,461 --> 00:14:24,461
Boss Nigger is a western, action, comedy film directed by Jack Arnold.

3
00:21:27,692 --> 00:21:33,692
Two black bounty hunters ride into a small town
out West in pursuit of an outlaw.

4
00:28:36,923 --> 00:28:42,923
They discover that the town has no sheriff, and soon take over that
position, much against the will of the mostly white townsfolk.

5
00:35:46,153 --> 00:35:52,153
Boss Nigger, played by Fred Williamson.

6
00:42:55,384 --> 00:43:01,384
Amos, played by D'Urville Martin.

7
00:50:04,615 --> 00:50:10,615
Mayor Griffin, played by R.G. Armstrong.

8
00:57:13,846 --> 00:57:19,846
Miss Pruitt, played by Barbara Leigh.

9
01:04:23,076 --> 01:04:29,076
Jed Clayton, played by William Smith.

10
01:11:32,307 --> 01:11:38,307
Boss Nigger (also known as Boss and The Black Bounty Killer) is a 1975 blaxploitation Western film directed by Jack
Arnold, starring former football player Fred Williamson, who also wrote and co-produced the film.

11
01:18:41,538 --> 01:18:47,538
It is the first film for which Williamson was
credited as screenwriter or producer.

12
01:25:50,769 --> 01:25:56,769
The tone is lighthearted.
